OL,13,G0350FWitness History
OL,14,     GIn 2011, the event debuted,
OL,15,     Gputting Nigerian style on the
OL,16,     Gmap. It has grown into a major
OL,17,     Gfashion event and won the 2025
OL,18,     GEarthshot Prize for
OL,19,     Gsustainability.
